			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『いまの？
勝手に　動かされたよな！？▼
いいや！　それよりも　消えた
プラズマ団を　探さないと！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:18:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:18:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船イベント後、自動で表示
・続けてswleader1_03
・1＝ライバル名</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:19:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:12:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:13:13" />
		</AttributeCell>
